@startuml 09_Enter_Conversation

title 09. When Member Enters Conversation

actor User
participant "Client App" as Client
participant "localStorage" as Storage
participant "Memory Cache" as Memory
participant "Crypto Layer" as Crypto
participant "Server API" as Server

User -> Client: Click on conversation
activate Client

Client -> Server: GET /conversations/{conv_id}
activate Server
Server --> Client: {latest_token_version: "v_1.3.5",\nmember_key: "...", ...}
deactivate Server

' Check localStorage for token
Client -> Storage: Check for "v_1.3.5"
activate Storage

alt Token in localStorage
    Storage --> Client: encrypted_token
    deactivate Storage
    note right of Client
      Token cached locally
      Skip server fetch
    end note
    
else Token NOT in localStorage
    Storage --> Client: NOT FOUND
    deactivate Storage
    
    Client -> Client: Fetch token from server
    note right of Client
      See "Fetch Conversation Data"
      flow (Diagram 08) for details
    end note
    
    Client -> Server: GET /token-versions/v_1.3.5
    activate Server
    Server --> Client: encrypted_token
    deactivate Server
    
    Client -> Storage: Store encrypted_token
    activate Storage
    Storage --> Client: Stored
    deactivate Storage
end

' Decrypt member_key to get group_key
Client -> Crypto: Decrypt member_key
activate Crypto
note right of Crypto
  group_key = Decrypt(
    member_key,
    identity_secret
  )
  
  identity_secret never transmitted
  stays on device
end note
Crypto --> Client: group_key (plaintext)
deactivate Crypto

' Decrypt token with group_key
Client -> Crypto: Decrypt token
activate Crypto
note right of Crypto
  token = Decrypt(
    encrypted_token,
    group_key
  )
end note
Crypto --> Client: token (plaintext)
deactivate Crypto

' Store decrypted token in memory
Client -> Memory: Store token in memory
activate Memory
note right of Memory
  Decrypted token exists
  ONLY in memory
  
  Cleared when:
  - User leaves conversation
  - User logs out
  - Browser/tab closes
end note
Memory --> Client: Stored
deactivate Memory

Client --> User: Conversation ready\n(can read and send messages)
deactivate Client

note over User, Server
  At this point:
  ✅ group_key in memory (from member_key)
  ✅ token in memory (from encrypted_token)
  ✅ Can decrypt/encrypt messages
  ✅ No plaintext keys on disk
  🧠 All sensitive data in RAM only
end note

@enduml
